   <h3> Primary and Alternate Characters</h3>
   <p>
   
<blockquote>
<h4>Primaries are Primary, alts are secondary</h4>

<p>Each member of Bloodhorde is required to specify their primary character.
Your primary character is the character that
you spend the most time playing.  You may specify only one primary character.

Primary characters get the full benefit of the guild.  This includes rewards,
gifts, and first chance at raid loot.  However, primary characters have the
one requirement that you must advance the character at least 1 level of
experience every 3 weeks until you reach level 50.  After that, the
requirement is dropped.  If you fail to do so, the character will be
assigned to the Blood Minion rank.  Again, this is to encourage people to play
their primary characters as much as possible.

<p>Blood Minions, or alternate characters still have access to the guild
treasury and library.  However, alt characters will not be allowed to
advance beyond Blood Minion, which means they will always be behind primary
characters for loot on raids.
 
<p>Bloodhorde will allow you to have up to 3 alternate characters in
Bloodhorde. However, your primary character must be at least level 35 and obtain the rank of 'Horde Member' before we will allow you to have any alternate characters in Bloodhorde. At level 40, we will allow you to have 2, and at level 50, we will allow you to have 3 alternates. 

<p>Bloodhorde does not wish to tell people how to play their account.  However,
one of our goals is to someday do dragon and plane raids.  We want to
encourage people to play their primary characters as much as possible so that
we will all be lvl 50+ some day.  We do not want a guild full of lvl 30's.
Alternate characters should be thought of as the characters you play when you cannot get a group for your primary.

<p>Note that your alternate characters must also meet 
  the standard <a href="/index.pl?node=Bloodhorde%20Membership&lastnode_id=1003">Bloodhorde Membership</a> guidelines (evil, min lvl 24, etc.).



